request.description:
Full verification record (MongoDB document). Used by Identity Service and compliance.

Response 200: KycDocumentMongoDB {
  verificationId, userId, status, fullName, dateOfBirth, documentNumber, documentType,
  submittedAt, decidedAt, decision: { approved, confidence, reason, canRetry, retryDelayHours, userFacingRejectionMessage }
}
Response 404: Not Found

Check if a user can retry KYC. Max 3 attempts per 30-day window. Infrastructure failures do NOT count against the limit.

Response 200: {
  userId, eligible: boolean, remainingAttempts: int,
  recentRejections: int, windowDays: 30, totalLifetimeAttempts: long
}

body.raw:
{
  "reviewOutcome": "APPROVED",
